From f9613b30d14486ecdf673c0e5852a9fcd2fc3f80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carlo Savignano <carlosavignano@aospa.co>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:01:31 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] base: introduce pocket lock

Block touch screen and keys inputs when device is in pocket, with a
secure overlay and a safe-door long-press power to dismiss it.
PocketService prefers the vendor pocket sensor when defined via
config_pocketJudgeVendorSensorName, falling back to proximity+light.

